[{"title":"效黄鲁直","author":"靳学颜","text":"一旬三馈浆，十日一栉沐。\n迫而后能应，希声犹不足。\n被褐诣谂公，共尔一盂粥。\n澹然出世情，了了无缚束。\n因举赵州话，白兆一橛木。\n瞠目不解答，彼已两无触。\n作别不作别，黄叶埋经屋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草桥即席寄以腾","author":"靳学颜","text":"旧国春深草似烟，年年此际对离筵。\n才闻柳外歌三叠，已识尊前路五千。\n剑阁啼猿梅雨夜，锦江驻马麦秋天。\n从今莫问西来雁，纵有风翰不到川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京暮春歌","author":"靳学颜","text":"三月杨花满御沟，可怜春色亦东流。\n行人不用多惆怅，鹈渼年年唤白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7820,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东京歌","author":"靳学颜","text":"濯龙门外马车流，谁人不道入青楼。\n卢家少妇鸣筝坐，逢着春光不解愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7821,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渭城曲","author":"靳学颜","text":"春风送客渭城西，折柳亭前落日低。\n骢马渐随尘影没，黄鹂飞上戍楼啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7822,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听陈东阜弹琴","author":"靳学颜","text":"逐客经年滞楚乡，萧条两鬓已秋霜。\n逢人唯奏《思归引》，易水燕山总断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7823,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲二首 其一","author":"任淳","text":"十八羽林郎，飞腾事朔方。\n青萍玄锦毂，赤兔紫丝缰。\n沙漠今巢穴，燕然古战场。\n王庭须远遁，卫霍在边疆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7824,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲二首 其二","author":"任淳","text":"登坛临玉塞，报主荷金戈。\n汉节当关重，胡笳出塞多。\n气吞玄朔垒，兵洗白洋波。\n休信单于款，谋穷伪请和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7825,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜袭虏","author":"苏志皋","text":"朔风利似刀，朔雪密如织。\n四山号虎兕，万卒无生色。\n号令等风霆，直捣龙沙北。\n夜半缚呼韩，天明传蓐食。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盱眙山馆","author":"苏志皋","text":"山馆雨初歇，村园菜正肥。\n摘花引寒蝶，冉冉过篱飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨虚楼还任饶阳","author":"苏志皋","text":"澹烟疏雨禁城秋，彰义门前古渡头。\n欲把相思付流水，芦沟日夜总悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏寄题隆兴寺禅房","author":"苏志皋","text":"蒲萄引蔓枣开花，台殿参差日影斜。\n一客不来双燕语，老僧闲欲晒袈裟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜雀妓","author":"顿锐","text":"西陵芳草合，松柏半为薪。\n宫殿飞铜雀，下饮漳河滨。\n檀烟冷余烬，垞帐网流尘。\n白头歌舞妓，来教晋宫人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西巡曲","author":"顿锐","text":"飞轮击水日三千，咫尺长安在日边。\n试向茂陵高处望，未央前殿立铜仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同杨都督登医无闾","author":"谷继宗","text":"海门日出上无闾，疑是骊龙抱夜珠。\n万里太行天堑角，千年辽左北门枢。\n猩红岭外稀来雁，鸭绿江头有巨鱼。\n锁钥只今凭卫霍，朵颜密迩费踟蹰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7832,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙山别业即事","author":"栗应宏","text":"葺屋空林伴翠微，柴门无事柳依依。\n隔年药物频宜日，近午茶烟欲上衣。\n山郭岁时流水旧，野堂风雨到人稀。\n兴来独步多寻赏，为问茅君理息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7833,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"栗应宏","text":"凤凰楼下散宫花，金错裁成五色霞。\n空有青春寄刀剪，不如红叶到人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7834,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴姬行","author":"栗应宏","text":"吴姬十五游燕赵，少小离家那得知。\n歌向尊前将进酒，低回却忆采莲时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7835,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居二首 其一","author":"方元焕","text":"冥心无住着，水石澹幽居。\n风物花含早，阳春鸟弄初。\n病减烧丹灶，情欣种树书。\n地偏非辟俗，林卧谷神虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7836,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居二首 其二","author":"方元焕","text":"兀兀坐长日，行园恰晚晴。\n畦蔬经雨足，山木到云平。\n野老水上语，轻风林际生。\n年来知抱瓮，犹听辘轳声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7837,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日独酌","author":"刘效祖","text":"南山遥对菊花开，欲采无人为举杯。\n纵说柴桑贫谢客，何曾不许白衣来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7838,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"刘效祖","text":"杨柳千条拂地垂，春风送客妾心悲。\n谁家年少轻离别，偏把愁声笛里吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7839,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲二首 其一","author":"刘效祖","text":"龙沙近接古檀州，多少从军倚戍楼。\n寒夜不堪愁绝处，西山片月挂城头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7840,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲二首 其二","author":"刘效祖","text":"朔风吹雪渡沙场，传道单于猎白狼。\n北望征尘何处是，暮云无际草苍茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7841,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌","author":"刘效祖","text":"元会初分庭燎光，君王亲御紫霞觞。\n不知五夜春多少，白日犹闻蜡炬香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7842,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结屋","author":"郭本","text":"贮木二十年，一屋未必就。\n风雨日薄蚀，土花起皴皱。\n捐弃弗忍言，黾勉始结构。\n因循复三载，石雨穿寒溜。\n枯栋三两横，客来不敢留。\n人生须盖藏，辗转事饤饾。\n握粟出经费，厨人生怨诟。\n自笑鸠为巢，未了先白首。\n休哉孙五郡，去官借车厩。\n至今清白声，犹不愧屋漏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7843,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭杨焦山继盛","author":"郭本","text":"滚滚数行泪，远为杨焦山。\n反复读谏草，五内皆潸然。\n自昔如弦直，累累死道边。\n机事渊海深，孰能察其端。\n天声震西北，地轴摇东南。\n日月复薄蚀，山湮谷成渊。\n问地地不语，吁天天不怜。\n孤愁何所极，塞于天地间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7844,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过以祯西庄","author":"郭本","text":"杲日明西野，绿荫连松篁。\n清风徘徊至，满座纳虚凉。\n门窗见凫峄，苍翠飘岚光。\n时闻读书声，伊吾禾黍场。\n东邻有坛杏，雨过生微香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7845,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山寺","author":"董谷","text":"孤绝江心寺，烟波接渺茫。\n浪花浮石磴，帆影落僧床。\n金碧辉天界，歌钟起下方。\n月明潮落后，倚槛听鸣榔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7846,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云山图","author":"董谷","text":"众绿献秋色，寒山生夕容。\n林间静茅宇，云外响村舂。\n落日行文豹，澄江飞断鸿。\n遥怜徐孺子，一榻坐千峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 辽阳","author":"董谷","text":"摇空白浪见玄菟，遍野黄羊是福余。\n最苦辽阳城下戍，月明清泪下吹芦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临清柳枝词二首 其一","author":"董谷","text":"春早持斋一月余，罗衣初试觅香车。\n丁宁夫婿严斋禁，顶上归来始破除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临清柳枝词二首 其二","author":"董谷","text":"结束腰肢细可怜，女奴相送上秋千。\n风光又是清明近，堕却金钗记去年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得燕燕于飞","author":"方九叙","text":"小院百花香，轻帘双燕翔。\n影随春陌近，声入午风长。\n趁蝶回雕砌，衔花赴彩梁。\n空闺朝复暮，徒切画眉长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涉江采芙蓉","author":"方九叙","text":"六月江南天，家家出采莲。\n并舟青雀近，分歌绿水连。\n看花误是面，摘叶戏成钿。\n夕阳归渡口，更觉晚妆鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病省署同邹继甫作八首 其四","author":"胡直","text":"掩阁乌同寂，升堂鹤共迟。\n乱花封印箧，飞鸟掣文移。\n公事痴能了，阴符懒未窥。\n散衙饶暇日，春院绿阴滋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙州书斋新霁客至","author":"胡直","text":"芳洲绮树接江城，曲巷回轩雾细生。\n弱柳窗中衔宿雨，游丝水面带新晴。\n林花点草粗成字，山鸟呼朋自有名。\n卧病一春萝径满，君来时复扫榛荆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听莺怀邹继甫二绝 其二","author":"胡直","text":"旭日高槐啼欲断，午风深竹弄还长。\n莫言绝域如天外，犹有莺声似省廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳栈岭","author":"闻人诠","text":"阳栈接高天，白云山下看。\n花落雨余雨，风吹寒食寒。\n纵目黄山外，停骖紫汉间。\n斜阳过广惠，始觉有人寰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜归洱海道中","author":"郑旦","text":"杳杳空原暮，萧萧旌旆行。\n长风吹海暗，新月傍人明。\n河影城头堕，秋声塞外生。\n客怀频倚剑，时事正论兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发洱海夕次滨川","author":"郑旦","text":"天高野旷瘴烟收，风急霜繁落木秋。\n箐道千盘临戍堡，山城百雉入边州。\n诸蕃乐岁休戎马，孤馆频年望斗牛。\n夜半角声吹激烈，纷纷凉月照人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲","author":"郑旦","text":"西望山前落叶秋，桑乾水上行云愁。\n笳声晓夜吹城楼。\n胡骑直过新聚落，吴儿初识古云州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌三首 其一","author":"郑旦","text":"昨夜月团团，郎在何处边？\n安能作百丈，日夕牵郎船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌三首 其二","author":"郑旦","text":"闻郎往潇湘，裁书寄雁去。\n郎行无定踪，书寄知何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌三首 其三","author":"郑旦","text":"欲织双鸳鸯，终日才成匹。\n寄君作香囊，长得系肘腋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"□□寺","author":"王献芝","text":"寻幽入仙源，遥闻钟声起。\n到门蟠古松，龙鳞半身死。\n对佛插高峰，寒翠妙空里。\n是时秋已深，黄叶满流水。\n老衲笑相迎，焚香问禅旨。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜直省中","author":"高叔嗣","text":"鹊绕瞻阶树，鸡栖入省台。\n蒙烟仙署合，悬月琐闱开。\n伏枕南天远，听笳北地哀。\n潘生应发变，司马倍肠回。\n为木同先伐，积薪异后来。\n无言秋夜永，申旦自徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再调考功作","author":"高叔嗣","text":"引疾三上书，微愿不克谐。\n徙官复在兹，心迹一何乖。\n轩裳日待旦，阊阖凌云排。\n入属金马籍，出与群龙偕。\n积贱讵有基，履荣诚无阶。\n但惜平生节，逾久浸沉埋。\n既妨来者途，谁明去矣怀。\n鸟迷思故林，水落存旧涯。\n唯当寻素业，归卧守荆柴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮作","author":"高叔嗣","text":"旦夕兹岁改，萧条旅思多。\n云物媚晴宇，气候属妍和。\n峥嵘新阳至，故景实蹉跎。\n感时岂不怀，二纪倏焉过。\n栖身惭择木，望道叹伐柯。\n如匏吾自系，匪玉孰为磨。\n有发日就长，心短独若何。\n但云毕夙志，唯力岂知他。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋情","author":"高叔嗣","text":"凉风吹庭树，萧然已暮秋。\n岁运空云往，客行胡久留。\n良时每易失，微志果难求。\n余光傥可积，但恐成山丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生日","author":"高叔嗣","text":"年往望空除，时来循虚至。\n明两无留晷，吹万有逸气。\n我行淹一周，辰适再值。\n束发岁更七，算齿纪将二。\n少怀沧洲心，壮损青霞志。\n淮禽终异化，魏瓠始同弃。\n五游存予欢，三费亡吾忌。\n达生庶不疚，乘流随所寄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古歌","author":"高叔嗣","text":"荆和当路泣，良璞为谁明。\n茫然大楚国，白日失兼城。\n燕石十袭重，鱼目一笑轻。\n古来共感叹，今予益吞声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起偶题","author":"高叔嗣","text":"空斋晨起坐，欢游罢不适。\n微雨东方来，阴霭倏终夕。\n久卧不知春，茫然怨行役。\n故园芳草色，惆怅今如积。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行至车骑关河南界尽处与亲知别","author":"高叔嗣","text":"山河未可尽，行处与春长。\n驿路沙俱白，关门柳欲黄。\n亲知还自反，离别各相望。\n且缓征车发，中心恋故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安肃县寺病居汉阳董玄亮见过时董奉使还阙","author":"高叔嗣","text":"门前易水路，下马汉阳人。\n野寺天晴雪，他乡日暮春。\n相逢一尊酒，久别满衣尘。\n不惮王程急，应怜伏枕身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓居慈仁寺游览","author":"高叔嗣","text":"终日仙宫掩，青松绕殿遮。\n到来长春草，行坐落天花。\n閤上王城尽，门前官路斜。\n微身随处是，何敢叹无家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与王庸之饮","author":"高叔嗣","text":"旅舍背都门，春风酒一尊。\n坐看芳草路，回忆故山村。\n为客谁称意，逢人未敢言。\n留君须醉倒，无奈日黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归自萧氏园作","author":"高叔嗣","text":"到来日已暮，归去恋柴门。\n空自山当舍，其如酒满尊。\n心知柳叶长，愁见桃花繁。\n立马一回首，令人思故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毗卢閤上同伍畴中诸公西望","author":"高叔嗣","text":"客来常一上，对此西山平。\n向夕檐楹立，凭空閤道行。\n杨花飞暮野，雨色动春城。\n却恋同携手，都忘羁旅情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食日毗卢閤上寄茂钦","author":"高叔嗣","text":"高楼晴出帝城南，杨柳千家夜雨含。\n欲换春衣惊客久，况逢寒食思谁堪。\n门前归路愁心绕，槛外群峰僻性耽。\n凭报故人应相笑，微身何事恋朝簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚出都门登寺閤","author":"高叔嗣","text":"柳叶桃花雨夜干，今年寒食在长安。\n淹留不为依双树，蹭蹬合应笑一官。\n行出都门常日暮，到来客舍已春阑。\n芳菲满眼心无奈，祇上毗卢閤上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别家兄张掖门时谪开州","author":"高叔嗣","text":"垂泣一相送，临途无限情。\n功名何物是，流落此心惊。\n梦里窥乡树，愁边滞帝城。\n终朝谁复语，犹去恋尘缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简子阳廷评","author":"高叔嗣","text":"终日祇缘此，微官奈若何。\n世情堪叹息，身计任蹉跎。\n客鬓凉风早，乡心夜雨多。\n故交谁复在，无厌数来过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"被言后作","author":"高叔嗣","text":"高材多负忧，洁身易招累。\n余生本顽疏，何取当年忌。\n守官郎署间，恒若临高坠。\n分过每自惊，名微久知愧。\n中岁反故丘，三载甘斥弃。\n秉操苟不坚，出处成二致。\n复此还京邑，长路果颠踬。\n赫赫明圣朝，贤俊骈足次。\n悬爵待天庭，但非通时器。\n人言敢谁尤，默默伤夙志。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简袁永之狱中","author":"高叔嗣","text":"本同江海人，俱为轩冕误。\n子抱无妄忧，余有多言惧。\n昔来始青阳，今此已白露。\n岂乏速进阶，苟得非余慕。\n罪至欲何言，直以愚慵故。\n众女竞中闺，独退反成怒。\n追诵古时人，蒙冤谁能诉。\n皇心肯照微，与子齐归路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别永之","author":"高叔嗣","text":"怜君方迁戍，况我婴愁疾。\n一别若流云，相从竟何日。\n生平托交游，弱冠弄篇帙。\n书愿藏名山，功期铭石室。\n安知事不就，跌宕情如一。\n已矣复谁陈，今亦反蓬筚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别德兆武选放归","author":"高叔嗣","text":"燕郊秋已甚，木叶乱纷纷。\n失路还为客，他乡独送君。\n罢归时共惜，弃置古常闻。\n莫作空山卧，令人望白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送皇甫博士重补曲周","author":"高叔嗣","text":"辞邑初耽寂，攻诗每晏居。\n贫家满坐客，闭户一床书。\n襆被情何忝，腰章意已疏。\n问君趋府处，高兴复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋同栗梦吉饮","author":"高叔嗣","text":"罢酒俱不乐，开帘望北轩。\n寒星出户少，秋露坠衣繁。\n散步怜新咏，平居想故园。\n空庭今夜月，客思岂堪言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]